      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_denki_01",
      "hash64": "8820DFDABE3D390F",
      "text": "Primera! Your eyeballs are MINE—caught in my\\nElectroweb! Whosawhatsit? Iono![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
