        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "DE6F2BA18338EA93",
      "text": "She sent me instead",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_denki_03",
      "hash64": "8820E1DABE3D3C75",
      "text": "Say whaaat?! You just became a Champion and\\nyou’re already out helpin’ La Primera?[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_denki_04",
      "hash64": "8820DADABE3D3090",
      "text": "Weren’t you JUST doing your Gym Test, like,\\nyesterday? You’re really kicking butt out there![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_denki_05",
      "hash64": "8820DBDABE3D3243",
      "text": "Wait, so, basically...what you’re tellin’ me is that\\nright now is the perfect time for us to collab?\\r\\nI can see it now! I’ll be more popular than ever!\\r\\nNyahahaaa![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_denki_06",
      "hash64": "8820DCDABE3D33F6",
      "text": "OK! I’m pickin’ up what you’re puttin’ down,\\nfriendo![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_denki_07",
      "hash64": "8820DDDABE3D35A9",
      "text": "Since you’re here to do the inspection for Geeta,\\nI’mma give you a show you’ll never forget![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_denki_08",
      "hash64": "8820E6DABE3D44F4",
      "text": "And I ’unno ’bout you, but I think it’s about time\\nwe got down to it! Whaddya say?[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
