      "label": "common_2020_denki_010_denki_retry",
      "hash64": "5A092D5262686886",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Yo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Are you ready to\\nsend\\r\\nmy\\r\\nviewer\\r\\ncount\\r\\nthrough\\r\\nthe roof?[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
